exports[`buildFluxPromptFromContext — snapshot regression > context prompt matches snapshot 1`] = `"Interior design makeover: redesign this rectangular living room. Style: warm amber and honey tones, biophilic plant-filled. warm amber undertones, honey oak, terracotta accents, biophilic layering, abundant greenery, living plants throughout. Materials: light oak, linen, wicker. standard-8ft ceiling with flat drywall. rectangular room, 14x18 ft. Intimate human-scale proportions — horizontal emphasis, low-profile furniture, no tall vertical elements. LIGHTING DIRECTIVE: Warm 5600K eastern morning light, energizing golden hour quality, long horizontal shadows raking east-to-west across floor and furniture, supplemented by 2700K ambient. Direction: from east. 2 medium windows from left. PRESERVE existing Hardwood flooring exactly — do not replace or cover the honey oak hardwood, natural patina retained. Walls in warm white, smooth-matte finish. Replace all furniture, rugs, art and decor. No television. Two throws — one folded on sofa, one on accent chair — two cushions in varying sizes. Comfortable density, curated. Premium materials, considered investment pieces. Photorealistic interior photograph, Shot from 5 feet height at eye level, 24mm f/8 lens, f/8, perfect exposure. No people, no text. Architectural Digest quality."`;

